From: Logos Maps <maps@logos.co>
Subject: [PATCH] Map: setLayerZoomRange, setLayerVisibility, getLayerJson, getSourceJson

Direct setters for a layer's zoom range and visibility, and JSON
introspection of a layer (full style-spec serialization including runtime
changes) and of a source (id, type, attribution, volatile).

Optional (capability-gated): §6 putLayer min/maxzoom, diagnostics.
Requires P1 (shares its JSON writer).

Upstream base: maplibre/maplibre-native-qt c3485f3 (docs/architecture.md section 14.1).
